    87	
    88	      # PLAN-168 W2 (AC-6/AC-6b): INV-4 as an executable assertion — install
    89	      # and upgrade produce the SAME pointer (byte identity + content
    90	      # soundness), repeat upgrades are idempotent, a degraded body is CURED
