   273	
   274	      # PLAN-166 F4 (OQ-4) - install/upgrade parity on the RESULTING TREES,
   275	      # per ceremony mode. NO continue-on-error, deliberately: the assertion
   276	      # this replaces was dead twice over (tautological AND wired into no
   277	      # workflow), and an escape hatch here would reinstate exactly that.
   278	      # Exit 2 (KNOWN-OPEN) is a FAILURE too - it NAMES the outstanding
   279	      # PLAN-166 W1 prerequisites instead of skipping them silently.
