     the old driver. Plan evidence (`.claude/plans/PLAN-166/repass-r1/**`,
     `.../debate/**`) is IMMUTABLE and deliberately OUT of scope: a sed there
     would break MANIFEST.sha256 and invalidate the re-pass."""
